#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_has_token_write
msgid "Fio Submit Token Set"
msgstr "Token Fio na zadávanie nastavený"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fio.field_fio_upload_mixin__fio_upload_state
msgid "Fio Upload"
msgstr "Odoslanie do Fio"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fio.field_fio_upload_mixin__fio_uploaded_at
msgid "Fio Uploaded At"
msgstr "Odoslané do Fio dňa"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_fio.selection__account_journal__fio_download_format__xml
msgid "Fio XML"
msgstr "Fio XML"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_download_format
msgid ""
"Fio XML is schema-backed and its dates are unambiguous; the JSON encoding "
"returns epoch milliseconds where the documentation promises a date string. "
"Change this only if you have a reason."
msgstr ""
"Fio XML má schému a jeho dátumy sú jednoznačné; kódovanie JSON vracia "
"milisekundy od epochy tam, kde dokumentácia sľubuje reťazec s dátumom. Meňte"
" len vtedy, ak máte dôvod."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"Fio allows one call per token every %(interval)s seconds; the next one is "
"possible in %(wait)s s."
msgstr ""
"Fio povoľuje jedno volanie na token za %(interval)s sekúnd; ďalšie je možné "
"o %(wait)s s."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:account_fio.fio_journal_action
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:account_fio.fio_account_menu
msgid "Fio banka"
msgstr "Fio banka"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_account_fio
msgid ""
"Fio banka API tokens per bank journal, with the mandatory 30-second throttle"
" and token-expiry watch."
msgstr ""
"Tokeny Fio banka API na bankovom denníku, s povinným 30-sekundovým odstupom "
"volaní a strážením platnosti tokenov."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_account_fio
msgid "Fio banka — connection"
msgstr "Fio banka — pripojenie"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_read_expiry
msgid ""
"Fio caps a token's validity at 180 days and refuses to issue one without an "
"expiry."
msgstr ""
"Fio obmedzuje platnosť tokenu na najviac 180 dní a bez dátumu konca "
"platnosti token nevydá."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"Fio does not accept this file: its root element is <%(tag)s>. Expected Fio's"
" own <Import>, a pain.001 or a pain.008."
msgstr ""
"Fio tento súbor neprijíma: jeho koreňový prvok je <%(tag)s>. Očakávaný "
"vlastný <Import> Fio, pain.001 alebo pain.008."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid "Fio keeps this account in %(fio)s while the journal is in %(journal)s."
msgstr ""
"Fio vedie tento účet v mene %(fio)s, zatiaľ čo denník je v mene %(journal)s."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"No Fio read token on %(name)s. Generate one in Fio internet banking under "
"Nastavení → API."
msgstr ""
"Na %(name)s nie je token Fio na čítanie. Vygenerujte ho v internet bankingu "
"Fio v Nastavení → API."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"No Fio submit token on %(name)s. Generate one in Fio internet banking with "
"the right 'Sledování účtu a zadávání platebních a inkasních příkazů'."
msgstr ""
"Na %(name)s nie je token Fio na zadávanie. Vygenerujte ho v internet "
"bankingu Fio s právom „Sledování účtu a zadávání platebních a inkasních "
"příkazů“."

#. module: account_fio
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_fio.fio_journal_action
msgid "No bank journal is connected to Fio yet"
msgstr "Zatiaľ nie je k Fio pripojený žiadny bankový denník"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_fio.selection__fio_upload_mixin__fio_upload_state__not_sent
msgid "Not sent"
msgstr "Neodoslané"

#. module: account_fio
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_fio.fio_journal_action
msgid ""
"Open a bank journal and paste a token from Fio internet banking\n"
"                (Nastavení → API) into its <b>Fio banka</b> section."
msgstr ""
"Otvorte bankový denník a vložte token z internet bankingu Fio\n"
"                (Nastavení → API) do jeho časti <b>Fio banka</b>."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fio.field_res_partner__fio_payment_reason
msgid "Platební titul"
msgstr "Platobný titul"

#. module: account_fio
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fio.account_journal_view_list_fio
msgid "Read token"
msgstr "Token na čítanie"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_fio.selection__fio_upload_mixin__fio_upload_state__sent
msgid "Sent to Fio"
msgstr "Odoslané do Fio"

#. module: account_fio
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fio.account_journal_view_list_fio
msgid "Submit token"
msgstr "Token na zadávanie"

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"The Fio %(label)s on %(name)s expires on %(date)s (field %(field)s). "
"Generate a new one in internet banking; it becomes usable 5 minutes after "
"authorisation."
msgstr ""
"Platnosť tokenu Fio (%(label)s) na %(name)s končí %(date)s (pole %(field)s)."
" Vygenerujte nový v internet bankingu; použiteľný je 5 minút po autorizácii."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_fio_upload_mixin__fio_id_instruction
msgid ""
"The idInstruction Fio returned for the uploaded batch. It is the batch's "
"number in internet banking, and is NOT the same number as the instruction id"
" that later appears on statement lines."
msgstr ""
"Hodnota idInstruction, ktorú Fio vrátilo pre odoslanú dávku. Je to číslo "
"dávky v internet bankingu a NIE JE to to isté číslo ako ID pokynu, ktoré sa "
"neskôr objavuje na riadkoch výpisu."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid "The payment file is not valid XML."
msgstr "Platobný súbor nie je platné XML."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The previous upload's answer was lost, so nobody knows whether Fio holds "
"this batch. Check internet banking for an unauthorised batch and record what"
" you found — there is a button for each answer — before sending anything."
msgstr ""
"Odpoveď na predchádzajúce odoslanie sa stratila, takže nikto nevie, či Fio "
"túto dávku má. Skôr než čokoľvek odošlete, skontrolujte v internet bankingu,"
" či tam nie je neautorizovaná dávka, a zaznamenajte, čo ste zistili — pre "
"každú odpoveď je tlačidlo."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid "There is no payment file to send."
msgstr "Nie je čo odoslať — chýba platobný súbor."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"This record has no bank journal, so there is nothing to tell Fio which "
"account the money leaves."
msgstr ""
"Tento záznam nemá bankový denník, takže nie je čím Fio oznámiť, z ktorého "
"účtu peniaze odchádzajú."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid "This record is not ready to be sent to Fio."
msgstr "Tento záznam nie je pripravený na odoslanie do Fio."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"This token belongs to Fio account %(fio)s, but journal %(journal)s is "
"configured with %(journal_account)s. One token serves one account — using it"
" here would import another account's movements."
msgstr ""
"Tento token patrí k účtu Fio %(fio)s, ale denník %(journal)s má nastavený "
"účet %(journal_account)s. Jeden token slúži jednému účtu — jeho použitie tu "
"by naimportovalo pohyby cudzieho účtu."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"This was already sent to Fio as batch %(batch)s. Sending it again would "
"create a second batch, and authorising both in internet banking would pay "
"everything twice."
msgstr ""
"Toto už bolo do Fio odoslané ako dávka %(batch)s. Opätovné odoslanie by "
"vytvorilo druhú dávku a autorizácia oboch v internet bankingu by všetko "
"zaplatila dvakrát."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_write
msgid ""
"Token with the right 'Sledování účtu a zadávání platebních a inkasních "
"příkazů'. Used only when a payment order is sent. Keep it separate from the "
"read token: a token that can only read cannot pay anyone, and each token has"
" its own 30-second budget."
msgstr ""
"Token s právom „Sledování účtu a zadávání platebních a inkasních příkazů“. "
"Používa sa iba pri odoslaní platobného príkazu. Držte ho oddelene od tokenu "
"na čítanie: token, ktorý vie len čítať, nikomu nezaplatí, a každý token má "
"vlastný 30-sekundový rozpočet volaní."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_read
msgid ""
"Token with the right 'Sledování účtu'. Used by the statement pull. Generate "
"it in Fio internet banking under Nastavení → API; it becomes usable 5 "
"minutes after authorisation."
msgstr ""
"Token s právom „Sledování účtu“. Používa ho sťahovanie výpisov. Vygenerujte "
"ho v internet bankingu Fio v Nastavení → API; použiteľný je 5 minút po "
"autorizácii."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_fio.selection__fio_upload_mixin__fio_upload_state__unknown
msgid "Unknown — check the bank"
msgstr "Neznáme — overte v banke"

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/fio_upload_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"Upload to Fio ended without an answer: %(error)s<br/><br/>The batch may or "
"may not exist in the bank. Check internet banking before sending again."
msgstr ""
"Odoslanie do Fio skončilo bez odpovede: %(error)s<br/><br/>Dávka v banke byť"
" môže, ale nemusí. Pred opätovným odoslaním skontrolujte internet banking."

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid "read token"
msgstr "token na čítanie"

#. module: account_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid "submit token"
msgstr "token na zadávanie"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_res_partner__fio_payment_reason
msgid ""
"ČNB payment reason used as the default on foreign payments to this partner, "
"where Fio requires one. Set it on the partner because it follows what you "
"buy from them, not what any single invoice happens to be."
msgstr ""
"Platobný titul ČNB použitý ako predvolený pri zahraničných platbách tomuto "
"partnerovi, kde ho Fio vyžaduje. Nastavuje sa na partnerovi, pretože sa "
"odvíja od toho, čo od neho nakupujete, nie od jednotlivej faktúry."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model,name:account_fio.model_fio_upload_mixin
msgid "Fio Payment Upload"
msgstr "Odoslanie platby do Fio"

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_write_expiry
msgid ""
"Fio caps a token's validity at 180 days and refuses to issue one without an "
"expiry, so every token has one — but the API does not report it. Copy it "
"from internet banking when you paste the token: left empty, the expiry "
"warning cannot fire and payment orders will start failing without notice."
msgstr ""
"Fio obmedzuje platnosť tokenu na 180 dní a bez dátumu platnosti "
"token nevydá, takže ho má každý token — API ho však nehlási. "
"Skopírujte ho z internetbankingu spolu s tokenom: ak zostane "
"prázdny, upozornenie na expiráciu sa nespustí a platobné príkazy "
"začnú bez varovania zlyhávať."

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_read_expiry
msgid ""
"Fio caps a token's validity at 180 days and refuses to issue one without an "
"expiry, so every token has one — but the API does not report it. Copy it "
"from internet banking when you paste the token: left empty, the expiry "
"warning cannot fire and the feed will stop without notice."
msgstr ""
"Fio obmedzuje platnosť tokenu na 180 dní a bez dátumu platnosti "
"token nevydá, takže ho má každý token — API ho však nehlási. "
"Skopírujte ho z internetbankingu spolu s tokenom: ak zostane "
"prázdny, upozornenie na expiráciu sa nespustí a sťahovanie výpisov "
"sa bez varovania zastaví."